# Missing Icon Files

The following icon files need to be generated before PWA deployment:

## Required Files:
- [ ] favicon.ico (16x16, 32x32, 48x48)
- [ ] apple-touch-icon.png (180x180)
- [ ] pwa-192x192.png (192x192)
- [ ] pwa-512x512.png (512x512)

## How to Generate:
See README.md in this directory for detailed instructions.

## Quick Start:
1. Visit https://realfavicongenerator.net/
2. Upload your logo (preferably 512x512 PNG or SVG)
3. Download generated files
4. Place them in this directory
5. Delete this .gitkeep-icons file

## Temporary Development:
The icon-placeholder.svg can be converted to PNG formats for temporary development use.
